sequenceDiagram
  participant S1 as S1 Order
  participant S2 as S2 Inventory
  participant S3 as S3 Payment
  S1->>S1: update own DB
  S1->>S2: event
  S2->>S2: update own DB
  S2->>S3: event
  S3->>S3: payment fails
  S3-->>S2: failure event
  S2-->>S2: rollback
  S2-->>S1: failure event
  S1-->>S1: rollback
